fact:"With beta0 and agamma evaluated as displayed, including the formal middle-case epsilon=1/8, beta0<=agamma<=1+gamma, 0<=agamma<1 and theta>=gamma. The three values of theta are (1/2+2*gamma)/(5/2-gamma), 11/17, and (1+gamma)/2.",
